## education 风格 CSS 示例

```css
#background {
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f5f7fa 0%, #e8f4fd 100%);
  position: absolute;
  width: 1920px;
  height: 1080px;
}
```

## 字幕样式（通用）

```css
.subtitle {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 80px;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  color: #ffffff;
  font-family: "Source Han Sans CN", "思源黑体", sans-serif;
  font-size: 48px;
